[node name="ObservatoryRoof" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "Classroom roof: glazed west slope faces Earth, solid east deck. Visuals are separate from the two-box collider (world layer). Glass is unshaded and casts no shadow so sunlight and the sky stay visible cheaply. Origin matches the classroom origin; walls top out at y = 5."

